MODULE: InstallUsesCapturedIdentityFreshAlias
TARGET: InstallUsesCapturedIdentity
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: cutover re-resolves the alias and labels an old-source scan with the new physical identity
PERTURBS: Install

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "validated"
    /\ bound' = candidate /\ view' = shadow /\ generation' = generation + 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "validated"
    /\ bound' = alias /\ view' = shadow /\ generation' = generation + 1
--- END
